@NOT_SPACE = [A AE Aacute Abreve Abreveacute Abrevedotbelow Abrevegrave Abrevehookabove Abrevetilde Acircumflex Acircumflexacute Acircumflexdotbelow Acircumflexgrave Acircumflexhookabove Acircumflextilde Adieresis Adotbelow Agrave Ahookabove Amacron Aogonek Aring Atilde B C Cacute Ccaron Ccedilla Ccircumflex Cdotaccent D Dcaron Dcroat E Eacute Ebreve Ecaron Ecircumflex Ecircumflexacute Ecircumflexdotbelow Ecircumflexgrave Ecircumflexhookabove Ecircumflextilde Edieresis Edotaccent Edotbelow Egrave Ehookabove Emacron Eng Eogonek Eth Etilde F G Gbreve Gcircumflex Gcommaaccent Gdotaccent Germandbls H Hbar Hcircumflex Hdotbelow I I.1 IJ Iacute Iacute.1 Ibreve Ibreve.1 Icircumflex Icircumflex.1 Idieresis Idieresis.1 Idotaccent Idotaccent.1 Idotbelow Idotbelow.1 Igrave Igrave.1 Ihookabove Ihookabove.1 Imacron Imacron.1 Iogonek Iogonek.1 Itilde Itilde.1 J Jcircumflex K Kcommaaccent L Lacute Lcaron Lcommaaccent Ldot Ldotbelow Lslash M N Nacute Ncaron Ncommaaccent Ntilde O OE Oacute Obreve Ocircumflex Ocircumflexacute Ocircumflexdotbelow Ocircumflexgrave Ocircumflexhookabove Ocircumflextilde Odieresis Odotbelow Ograve Ohookabove Ohorn Ohornacute Ohorndotbelow Ohorngrave Ohornhookabove Ohorntilde Ohungarumlaut Omacron Oslash Otilde P Q R Racute Rcaron Rcommaaccent S Sacute Scaron Scedilla Scircumflex Scommaaccent T Tbar Tcaron Tcommaaccent Thorn U Uacute Ubreve Ucircumflex Udieresis Udotbelow Ugrave Uhookabove Uhorn Uhornacute Uhorndotbelow Uhorngrave Uhornhookabove Uhorntilde Uhungarumlaut Umacron Uogonek Uring Utilde V W Wacute Wcircumflex Wdieresis Wgrave X Y Yacute Ycircumflex Ydieresis Ydotbelow Ygrave Yhookabove Ytilde Z Zacute Zcaron Zdotaccent a a.1 a.sups aacute aacute.1 abreve abreve.1 abreveacute abreveacute.1 abrevedotbelow abrevedotbelow.1 abrevegrave abrevegrave.1 abrevehookabove abrevehookabove.1 abrevetilde abrevetilde.1 acircumflex acircumflex.1 acircumflexacute acircumflexacute.1 acircumflexdotbelow acircumflexdotbelow.1 acircumflexgrave acircumflexgrave.1 ac